WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.588 --> 00:00:03.505
(people screaming)

00:00:06.648 --> 00:00:07.481
(gunshot and sirens)

00:00:07.481 --> 00:00:10.014
(dramatic music)

00:00:10.014 --> 00:00:11.582
- [News Reporter] The
President, ladies and gentlemen,

00:00:11.582 --> 00:00:14.718
is dead at Parkland Hospital in Dallas.

00:00:14.718 --> 00:00:17.468
(dramatic music)

00:00:26.714 --> 00:00:27.547
(gunshot)

00:00:27.547 --> 00:00:30.297
(dramatic music)

00:00:47.346 --> 00:00:49.548
- [President Johnson] The
greatest leader of our time

00:00:49.548 --> 00:00:51.530
has been struck down

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:54.197
by the foulest deed of our time.

00:00:55.419 --> 00:00:58.169
(dramatic music)

00:01:15.668 --> 00:01:19.335
(fast-paced dramatic music)

00:03:10.936 --> 00:03:13.769
(dramatic music)

